&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. See Michael D. Nass, &amp;quot;King of Ruins: Canada&#039;s Spiritualist Prime Minister,&amp;quot; in &lt;em&gt;Doubt: the Journal of the Creative Skepticism Society,&lt;/em&gt; vol. 30 no. 1 (Spring 2004): 81-111.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. See Melissa Bradbury, &amp;quot;Bumbling Past the Veil: The Watts Commission, 1928-1931,&amp;quot; in &lt;em&gt;The Generalist,&lt;/em&gt; vol. 67 no. 4 (Winter 2010): 12-46.&lt;/div&gt;
