&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;The British North America Act, 1867,&lt;/em&gt; Canada&#039;s &lt;em&gt;de facto&lt;/em&gt; constitution until 1982.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. See Karen T. Elstrom, &lt;em&gt;Coming Out to Canada: Why the Foundation Revealed Itself to a Nation of Only Twelve Million People&lt;/em&gt; (Site-43: Administration and Oversight Internal Press, 1999).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. See Udo A. Okorie, &amp;quot;Everything You Need to Know About Acroamatic Abatement But Were Too Confused by the Name to Ask,&amp;quot; &lt;em&gt;Gunk: The Journal of the Acroamatic Abatement Group,&lt;/em&gt; vol. 81 no. 4: 18-29.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. See Wynn R. Rydderech, &lt;em&gt;Toilets of the Gods: Neutralizing Secondary Anomalies&lt;/em&gt; (Site-43: Acroamatic Abatement Internal Press, 1952).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. See [EXPUNGED], &lt;em&gt;Not Our Panthers, Not Our Lake: The History of Nexus-94&lt;/em&gt; (Site-43: Nexus Affairs Internal Press, 2009).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. See Nhung T. Ngo, &amp;quot;Little Man in a Big Hat: Raynard Watts and His Magical Ride,&amp;quot; in &lt;em&gt;Open Minds,&lt;/em&gt; vol 47 (2008): 139-171.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-40880-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. See Noor Zaman, &lt;em&gt;Site-43 Personnel Handbook: Your Life in Containment&lt;/em&gt; (Site-43: Hiring and Regulation Internal Press, 2019).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
